图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Route DeepSeek Harness host-side fetch (LLM calls, model discovery, plugin market, web search) through a local HTTP/HTTPS proxy such as Clash / mihomo / v2ray. No TUN mode, and no system proxy required.","id":"gh:1343446010","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-proxy","slug":"BuLongY/dsh-proxy","topics":["clash","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","proxy"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Route DeepSeek Harness host-side fetch (LLM calls, model discovery, plugin market, web search) throu"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"gh a local HTTP/HTTPS proxy such as Clash / mihomo / v2ray. No TUN mode, and no system proxy require"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" a local HTTP/HTTPS proxy such as Clash / mihomo / v2ray. No TUN mode, and no system proxy required."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-proxy"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Route **DeepSeek Harness host-side fetch** (LLM calls, model discovery, plugin market, web search) t"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"hrough a local HTTP/HTTPS proxy such as Clash / mihomo / v2ray. **No TUN mode**, and no system proxy"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ocal HTTP/HTTPS proxy such as Clash / mihomo / v2ray. **No TUN mode**, and no system proxy required."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Built for DSH **0.1.2-rc.1** and the dsh-market plugin layout."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **0.4.0 fix**: DSH 0.1.2 changed the client module contract to `factory(require) => exports` (was "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"`factory(module, exports, require)`) and dropped the `dsh-client-runtime` / `dsh-client-ui-slots` pa"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ckages. 0.3.x fails to load on both counts; 0.4.0 follows the new contract."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why this plugin"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"DSH Desktop / Web issues LLM traffic from the host Node process using global `fetch`:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- Windows / macOS system proxy settings do not apply\n- `HTTPS_PROXY` does not apply to Node global f"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"etch\n- DSH has no built-in proxy setting"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"When an API is blocked by Cloudflare IP reputation, or only reachable via a proxy, this plugin wraps"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" host `fetch` with undici `ProxyAgent`. Clash rule mode still decides what is direct vs proxied."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"From the Plugin Market, search **dsh-proxy**, or from a terminal:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Restart the DSH Web Host, then refresh the page."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The published package ships prebuilt `lib/` files. GitHub installs do **not** need `pnpm approve-bui"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"kage ships prebuilt `lib/` files. GitHub installs do **not** need `pnpm approve-builds` / `prepare`."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Setup"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Start Clash / mihomo / v2ray with mixed / HTTP port (default `7890`).\n2. Open DSH **Settings → HT"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"TP proxy**.\n3. Set host / port (or leave `127.0.0.1:7890`), keep Enable on.\n4. Optional: edit Direct"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" hosts (`localhost, 127.0.0.1, ::1` by default).\n5. Reload models or send a chat. Traffic now leaves"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" 127.0.0.1, ::1` by default).\n5. Reload models or send a chat. Traffic now leaves through the proxy."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Settings persist in DSH `settings.yaml` under `dsh-proxy:` and apply live."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Piece | Requirement |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| DSH | `0.1.2-rc.1` and later hosts that still expose `ctx.settings.register` and `settings.section"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"` |\n| Profile | `web` |\n| Node | `>= 20` |\n| Market | `dsh.bundle.patch`, bilingual README, prebuilt"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" client factory, no `prepare` script |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The 0.3.x line replaced the old `installSettingsSection` + `settings.plugin.item` APIs that broke af"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" replaced the old `installSettingsSection` + `settings.plugin.item` APIs that broke after DSH 0.1.1."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Implementation (0.4.0)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The host half no longer swaps global `fetch` for an undici one. It keeps **Node's native fetch** and"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" attaches an undici `dispatcher` to each request:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- Proxy-matching hosts use a `ProxyAgent`; `noProxy` hosts use an explicit `Agent` (direct).\n- Nativ"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"e `Request` / `Response`, streaming, and error semantics are preserved so SDK type checks keep worki"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ng.\n- Unloading the plugin restores the exact original `fetch`."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The client settings page registers into `settings.section` and depends on the `settingsScope`, `slot"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"s`, and `locale` services."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Desktop note"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"If a desktop profile fails to load because of one bad plugin, the app enters the **safe profile** an"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"d purges every user plugin from it at startup (`SAFE_MODE_PLUGIN_PURGE` in the log). The symptom is "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"plugins that keep disappearing and cannot be installed."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"`dsh-proxy` 0.4.0 does not trigger this by itself; other plugins in the same profile can, and should"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"does not trigger this by itself; other plugins in the same profile can, and should be checked first."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
